          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "подозревать (podozrevát) is built on под- \"under\" and the old root зр- \"to look\", as in зрение \"sight\", inherited through Old East Slavic zĭrěti \"to see\" (EtymDB): to watch from below. EtymDB lists the verb with no parent."
